  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 7th level, an invisible, poisonous aura extends 10 feet out from you when you are not incapacitated, but not through full cover. At the start of your turn, creatures of your choice within this aura take poison damage equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one).</p>\n<p>At 18th level, the range of this aura increases to 30 feet.</p>",
